      "writtenOn": "2020-05-27T16:10:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think that we need to completely hide the implementation, just prevent it from being used when not sdk_version is specified.\n\nDo_not_default_to_impl_when_no_sdk_version_is_specified is probably a bit long for a property name.\n\nHow about?\n\nIgnore_no_sdk_version *bool\n\nOr?\n\nDefault_scope *string - which if set must be set to one of the scope names, i.e. public/system/module-lib\n\nOr?\n\nDefault_to_stubs *bool",
      "revId": "783ed39f9aee89c18792c300e50652207bd450d3",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
